# OPTIONAL Cognito overrides.
#
# By default the app reads Cognito config from src/amplifyconfiguration.json.
# Set these NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars only to OVERRIDE that file (e.g. in CI or when
# building against a different environment). Copy to .env.local to use.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_USER_POOL_ID=us-east-1_XXXXXXXXX
# NEXT_PUBLIC_USER_POOL_CLIENT_ID=XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# NEXT_PUBLIC_IDENTITY_POOL_ID=us-east-1:xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
